   "replaces": "",
   "squares": [
    "labour"
   ],
   "es": "El trabajo gana palma; / Y quita el orin del alma.",
   "en": "Labour wins the palm, and then / scours the rust from souls of men.",
   "note": "One of the eight couplets of the other Labour squares, printed together in small roman, poorly inked. The d of <em>del alma</em> is damaged (<em>de lalma</em>). \"Palm\": the palm of victory at the last square (63).",
   "lit": "Labour wins the palm and removes the rust from the soul.",
